    "notes": "game_ids whose closing line has already been captured, so the */15 gate does not pull for them again. Keyed by The Odds API event id. Entries are dropped 14 days after kickoff. Written only after a pull succeeds \u2014 never before, so a failed pull retries.",
    "opener_note": "per-ISO-week record of the next-week line opener, keyed on the SUNDAY's ISO week (Sunday is the last day of an ISO week, so the Monday it fires on is a different week). fire_at is the last Sunday kickoff in America/New_York plus 4h, saved BEFORE those games disappear: /events drops a game once it finishes, so a gate that recomputed at fire time would never fire. triggered_at present = that week is done.",
    "missed_note": "games whose close was NEVER captured and whose miss has already been reported as a GitHub issue comment. Tracked so the 6h lookback reports each game once instead of once every 15 minutes. These are losses, not recoveries."
  },
